1. The grammar shows `<E>` can be empty (epsilon production), but the parser uses a while loop instead of proper recursion
2. The grammar shows `<Y>` has a recursive production `["$", "<Y>"]`, but the parser only matches `["$", "v"]`
3. The parser needs to handle the empty production for `<E>`

